</style></div></div></main><footer aria-label="Status banner" class="Footer2U8XAPoGhlgO AppFooter rm-Banners"></footer><div class="ModalWrapper" id="ChatGPT-modal"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ng-non-bindable"><script id="ssr-props" data-initial-props="{&quot;sidebars&quot;:{},&quot;apiBaseUrl&quot;:&quot;/&quot;,&quot;baseUrl&quot;:&quot;/&quot;,&quot;search&quot;:{&quot;appId&quot;:&quot;T28YKFATPY&quot;,&quot;searchApiKey&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;indexName&quot;:&quot;readme_search_v2&quot;,&quot;projectsMeta&quot;:[{&quot;modules&quot;:{&quot;landing&quot;:true,&quot;docs&quot;:true,&quot;examples&quot;:true,&quot;reference&quot;:true,&quot;graphql&quot;:false,&quot;changelog&quot;:true,&quot;discuss&quot;:false,&quot;suggested_edits&quot;:false,&quot;logs&quot;:false,&quot;custompages&quot;:false,&quot;tutorials&quot;:false},&quot;id&quot;:&quot;650fb9307c258000529f63df&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Birdeye Documentation&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;birdeyedotso&quot;,&quot;subpath&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;nav_names&quot;:{&quot;docs&quot;:&quot;Documentation&quot;,&quot;reference&quot;:&quot;API Endpoints&quot;,&quot;changelog&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;discuss&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;recipes&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;tutorials&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}],&quot;UrlManager&quot;:{&quot;options&quot;:{&quot;child&quot;:false,&quot;parent&quot;:null,&quot;hasOneChild&quot;:false,&quot;project&quot;:null,&quot;version&quot;:null,&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;en&quot;},&quot;defaults&quot;:{&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}},&quot;urlManagerOpts&quot;:{&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;parent&quot;:{&quot;childrenProjects&quot;:[]},&quot;project&quot;:{&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;birdeyedotso&quot;},&quot;version&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;}},&quot;changelogs&quot;:[{&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;685a410d1f5eec00534d74ec&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Son Dang&quot;},&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;body&quot;:&quot;Introducing a new endpoint to retrieve token trades filtered by volume on Solana.\n\n## New Features\n\n### Trades - Token Filtered By Volume (V3) — Solana only\n\n#### [GET /defi/v3/token/txs-by-volume](https://docs.birdeye.so/reference/get-defi-v3-token-txs-by-volume#/)\n\nRetrieve a list of trades for a specified token with volume-based filters.\n\n**Features:**\n\n* Support time range filters beyond 30 days\n* Maximum limit of 500 transactions\n* Newly supported parameters:\n  * volume_type: usd or amount (token amount)\n  * min_volume and max_volume for volume-based filtering\n* Chain support: Solana only&quot;},&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-10-16T10:58:50.399Z&quot;,&quot;metadata&quot;:{&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;uri&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:null},&quot;keywords&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null},&quot;privacy&quot;:{&quot;view&quot;:&quot;public&quot;},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;20251015-release-txs-filtered-by-volume&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;2025.10.15 - Release Txs filtered by volume&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;added&quot;,&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;project&quot;:&quot;/projects/me&quot;},&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2025-10-16T10:58:50.399Z&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;/changelogs/68f0d0bb97cdab5050ac5592&quot;},{&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;685a410d1f5eec00534d74ec&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Son Dang&quot;},&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;body&quot;:&quot;Enhance visibility into account usage and improve trade query flexibility. This release introduces a new utility endpoint for tracking credit consumption and adds a tx_type filter to refine trader trade lookups.\n\n## New Features\n\n### New API to extract your current and past credits usage\n\n#### [GET /utils/v1/credits](https://docs.birdeye.so/reference/get-utils-v1-credits#/)\n\nRetrieve compute units (CUs) usage of your account.\n\n**Features:**\n\n* Retrieve current CUs usage with remaining and overage values with cost for current cycle.\n* Retrieve CUs usage in the past 1 year.\n\n***\n\n## Improvements\n\n### Add filter `tx_type` to Trader - Trades Seek By Time API\n\n#### [GET /trader/txs/seek_by_time](https://docs.birdeye.so/reference/get-trader-txs-seek_by_time#/)\n\nAdded tx_type filter to refine returned trades by transaction type.\n\n**Features:**\n\n* Default to `all` (returns all transaction types)\n* Available transactions types are: all, swap, add and remove&quot;},&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-10-16T10:30:11.243Z&quot;,&quot;metadata&quot;:{&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;uri&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:null},&quot;keywords&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null},&quot;privacy&quot;:{&quot;view&quot;:&quot;public&quot;},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;20251013-release-credits-usage&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;2025.10.13 - Release Credits Usage&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;added&quot;,&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;project&quot;:&quot;/projects/me&quot;},&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2025-10-16T11:04:01.040Z&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;/changelogs/68f0ce8717427d79c701a4bd&quot;},{&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;685a410d1f5eec00534d74ec&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Son Dang&quot;},&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;body&quot;:&quot;## New Features\n\n### Wallet First Tx Funded (only Solana)\n\n#### [POST /wallet/v2/tx/first-funded](https://docs.birdeye.so/reference/post-wallet-v2-tx-first-funded#/)\n\nReturns the first funding transactions of multiple wallets.\n\n**Features:**\n\n* Metrics include transaction hash, block time, block number, balance change, token address and decimals\n* Optional token-filtering to retrieve first funding transaction of a specific token\n* Query up to 50 wallets per request\n* Perfect for identifying new wallet&quot;},&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-09-12T08:33:01.417Z&quot;,&quot;metadata&quot;:{&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;uri&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:null},&quot;keywords&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null},&quot;privacy&quot;:{&quot;view&quot;:&quot;public&quot;},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;20250911-release-wallet-first-tx-funded-on-solana&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;2025.09.11 - Release Wallet First Tx Funded on Solana&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;added&quot;,&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;project&quot;:&quot;/projects/me&quot;},&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2025-09-12T08:33:01.417Z&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;/changelogs/68c3dbe54a1c1eb6e351527c&quot;},{&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;685a410d1f5eec00534d74ec&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Son Dang&quot;},&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;body&quot;:&quot;## New Features\n\n### Wallet PnL - Per Wallet (only Solana)\n\n#### [POST /wallet/v2/pnl/multiple](https://docs.birdeye.so/reference/get-wallet-v2-pnl-multiple#/)\n\nReturns PnL of a specific token across multiple wallets.\n\n**Features:**\n\n* Metrics include trade count, quantity, cashflow in USD, realized &amp; unrealized PnL, and pricing\n* Query up to 50 wallets per request\n* Perfect for tracking smart money and building token-specific data dashboards\n* For PnL of a specific wallet across multiple tokens, check out [Wallet - PnL (Per Token)](https://docs.birdeye.so/reference/get-wallet-v2-pnl#/) \n\n&lt;br /&gt;&quot;},&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-09-12T08:29:45.463Z&quot;,&quot;metadata&quot;:{&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;uri&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:null},&quot;keywords&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null},&quot;privacy&quot;:{&quot;view&quot;:&quot;public&quot;},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;20250910-release-wallet-pnl-per-wallet&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;2025.09.10 - Release Wallet PnL (Per Wallet)&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;added&quot;,&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;project&quot;:&quot;/projects/me&quot;},&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2025-09-12T08:33:00.391Z&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;/changelogs/68c3dab2d0ee46e4c765f01e&quot;},{&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;685a54693cb46e0052481d82&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;anh&quot;},&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;body&quot;:&quot;## New Features\n\n### Wallet - Tokens Balance (only Solana)\n\n#### [POST /wallet/v2/token-balance](https://docs.birdeye.so/reference/post-wallet-v2-token-balance#/)\n\n* New endpoint to fetch wallet token balances with normalized amounts, USD values, and token metadata.\n* Provides both raw balances (base units) and human-readable values.\n* Works seamlessly with [Wallet Current Net Worth](https://docs.birdeye.so/reference/get-wallet-v2-current-net-worth#/) for a complete view of holdings and portfolio value.&quot;},&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-08-28T13:53:50.997Z&quot;,&quot;metadata&quot;:{&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;uri&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:null},&quot;keywords&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null},&quot;privacy&quot;:{&quot;view&quot;:&quot;public&quot;},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;20250828-release-wallet-token-balance-v2&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;2025.08.28 - Release Wallet Token Balance V2&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;added&quot;,&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;project&quot;:&quot;/projects/me&quot;},&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2025-08-28T13:53:50.997Z&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;/changelogs/68b06015ef6000553baf672d&quot;}],&quot;discuss&quot;:[],&quot;guideCategories&quot;:[{&quot;pages&quot;:[{&quot;deprecated&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;isBodyEmpty&quot;:false,&quot;renderable&quot;:{&quot;status&quot;:true},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;overview&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Overview&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;basic&quot;,&quot;updatedAt&quot;:&quot;2025-09-14T13:05:48.000Z&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:[],&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;/branches/1.0/guides/overview&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;/branches/1.0/categories/guides/Documentation&quot;,&quot;parent&quot;:null},{&quot;deprecated&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;isBodyEmpty&quot;:false,&quot;renderable&quot;:{&quot;status&quot;:true},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;bug-bounty-program&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Bug Bounty Program&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;basic&quot;,&quot;updatedAt&quot;:&quot;2025